WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.523
A key challenge is heterogeneity: the same patient
population can appear very differently

00:00:05.603 --> 00:00:07.852
depending on the observation process,

00:00:07.932 --> 00:00:11.126
and that process shifts across countries, over time,

00:00:11.206 --> 00:00:13.581
and even between weekdays and weekends.

00:00:13.661 --> 00:00:16.917
The literature has studied covariate and label shift,

00:00:16.997 --> 00:00:20.821
but shift in the observation process itself is
under-explored.

00:00:20.901 --> 00:00:26.990
DeepJoint asks how explicitly modelling clinical
presence makes survival models more robust to it.
